{
 "title": "Chapter 6: The War That Spent 27 Million",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Chapter 6: The War That Spent 27 Million",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s07b01",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "On June 22, 1941, Nazi Germany launched Operation *Barbarossa*.",
     "shot": "c6_barb",
     "date": 1941,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       "w:launched",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s07i01",
     "text": "Did you *spot* it?",
     "shot": "in_same",
     "type": "STORY",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       0,
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s07i02",
     "text": "Napoleon invaded in *June*. Hitler invaded in June.",
     "shot": "in_same",
     "type": "STORY",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Hitler",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s07i03",
     "text": "*Same* plain. Same summer. Same idea: win before the road runs out.",
     "shot": "in_same",
     "type": "STORY"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07i04",
     "text": "It didn't work the *first* time either.",
     "shot": "in_same",
     "type": "STORY"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b02",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "More than *three* million soldiers poured across the border.",
     "shot": "map:barbarossa",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       "w:poured",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b03",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The Red Army, weakened by Stalin's purges and caught unprepared, was *overwhelmed*.",
     "shot": "map:barbarossa"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b04",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Whole armies were *encircled*.",
     "shot": "map:barbarossa"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b05",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Millions of Soviet soldiers were *captured*.",
     "shot": "map:barbarossa"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b06",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "By December, German troops were within 20 or 25 kilometres of *Moscow*.",
     "shot": "map:barbarossa",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:Moscow",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b07",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In the north, they surrounded *Leningrad*.",
     "shot": "map:barbarossa",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:Leningrad",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b08",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The siege lasted *872* days.",
     "shot": "c6_siege",
     "quiet": true,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b09",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "*Food* ran out.",
     "shot": "c6_siege",
     "quiet": true,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b10",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "People ate *wallpaper* paste and leather, and died in the streets.",
     "shot": "c6_siege",
     "quiet": true,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b11",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Among them was a girl named *Tanya* Savicheva.",
     "shot": "c6_tanya",
     "date": 1941,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b12",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "She was *eleven* years old.",
     "shot": "c6_tanya",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b13",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In a small *notebook*, she wrote down, page by page,",
     "shot": "c6_tanya",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b14",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "the *deaths* of her family.",
     "shot": "c6_tanya",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b17",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Her sister. Her grandmother. Her brothers.",
     "shot": "c6_tanya",
     "quiet": true,
     "date": 1942
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b18",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Her uncles.",
     "shot": "c6_tanya",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b19",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Her mother.",
     "shot": "c6_tanya",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b20",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The last entries are only a *few* words.",
     "shot": "c6_tanya",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b21",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Tanya herself died not long after.",
     "shot": "c6_tanya",
     "quiet": true,
     "date": 1944
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b22",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The siege killed *hundreds* of thousands of civilians.",
     "shot": "c6_candles",
     "date": 1944,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b23",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Perhaps around a *million*.",
     "shot": "c6_candles",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b24",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But Russia's *size* also saved it.",
     "shot": "c6_size",
     "date": 1941
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b25",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "As the Germans advanced, the Soviet state *dismantled* thousands of factories and loaded them onto trains. They were shipped beyond the Urals.",
     "shot": "map:evac",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:trains",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b27",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "*Workers* went with them.",
     "shot": "c6_factory",
     "date": 1942,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b28",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Production resumed in the *east*, far from the front,",
     "shot": "c6_factory",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "clang",
       "w:resumed",
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b29",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "turning out the *tanks* and shells that would win the war.",
     "shot": "c6_factory",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "clang",
       "w:tanks",
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b30",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Then came *Stalingrad*.",
     "shot": "c6_stalingrad",
     "date": 1942,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:Stalingrad",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b31",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "For months, soldiers fought *house* by house through ruins.",
     "shot": "c6_stalingrad",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b32",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In February 1943, the German Sixth Army, surrounded, *surrendered*.",
     "shot": "c6_stalingrad",
     "quiet": true,
     "date": 1943
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b33",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The *tide* had turned.",
     "shot": "c6_stalingrad",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:turned",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b34",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In May 1945, the Red Army took *Berlin*.",
     "shot": "c6_berlin",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:Berlin",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b35",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The cost was *staggering*.",
     "shot": "c6_cost",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b36",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Around *27* million Soviet citizens died.",
     "shot": "c6_cost",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b37",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "*More* than any other nation.",
     "shot": "c6_cost",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07i05",
     "text": "Bill number *three*: twenty-seven million.",
     "shot": "in_receipt",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b38",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Stalin drew a *lesson* from it.",
     "shot": "c6_lesson"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b39",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "*Never* again would Russia's western border be exposed.",
     "shot": "c6_lesson",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slam",
       "w:exposed",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}